    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whether as a performer or a stagehand, you found a home among the members of the Phantasmic Circus. While traveling the world to bring magic and wonder to delighted crowds, you picked up some illusion magic and sharpened your gift for performance and misdirection.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Constitution, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.lonJxas2HKXxZ2QX]{Arcane Artist}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Deception and Performance</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulDisguiseKi]{Disguise Kit}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulDisguiseKi]{Disguise Kit}, Gaming Set (any), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagCostume0000]{Costume}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagMirror00000]{Mirror}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 12 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
